ually  declared war on the taliban the united  states never actually  designated the taliban as a terrorist  organization  that's why it's so interesting that  president biden was so emphatic that he  doesn't trust the taliban  while at the same time saying he trusts  the agreement that the taliban signed  with the former administration so again  there's a lot of confusion here  i want to make one very serious  correction uh  president biden said repeatedly that  afghanistan has never been unified  in its entire history that's not true  afghanistan has been a unified country  has been a country that's been in the  30s 40s 50s and 60s  before the cold war before the united  states  the soviet union started fighting over  afghanistan afghanistan  was a small quiet peaceful country so  the united states  states and the rest of the world have a  lot to do with what happened  but what president biden said about  afghanistan never being a unified  country  is just not true david sydney we'll  leave it there but we thank you very  much for joining us and giving us your  point of view  all right thank you
 

